  "description": "Compute Manitoba individual income tax for calendar 2026 from the federal T1 workpaper. Covers provincial bands, the income-tested basic personal amount, family and other non-refundable credits, dividends, AMT and split-income handoffs, and separate refundable housing, caregiver and investment credits. Keeps actual 2025 annual forms in the 2025-2026 filing cycle separate from provisional 2026 estimates. Includes farmer and northern-resident questions and routes sales tax and employer payroll levies to their own methods.",
